Package: unitedR
Title: Assessment and Evaluation of Formations in United
Version: 0.4
Authors@R: person(given="David", family="Schindler",
        email="dv.schindler@gmail.com", role=c("aut","cre"))
Description: United is a software tool which can be downloaded at the
        following website
        <http://www.schroepl.net/pbm/software/united/>. In general, it
        is a virtual manager game for football teams. This package
        contains helpful functions for determining an optimal formation
        for a virtual match in United. E.g. knowing that the opponent
        has a strong defensive it is advisable to beat him in the
        midfield. Furthermore, this package contains functions for
        computing the optimal usage of hardness in a game.
Depends: R (>= 3.1.2), methods, plyr
